# Copy to patterns.local (git-ignored) and replace with your own values.
# One extended regex per line; # comments and blank lines are skipped.
# The check never prints a match from this file, only where it is.
# Your login name and home directory are already checked without being listed here.

# Owner and partner identity
# [Ff]irst[ ._-]?[Ll]ast
# you@gmail\.com

# Business and workplace (real customers never appear anywhere in the repo)
# Real Business Name
# Employer Name

# Network and hosts
# yourdomain\.com
# shop\.yourdomain\.com
# 192\.168\.1\.

# Timezone give-aways in content
# America/Your_City
